aims-os-centre-senegal (2.1+1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * First centre payload: apt cache wiring for the Mbour campus.
    /usr/lib/aims-os/apt-proxy-detect probes the apt-cacher-ng on
    serveur 2 (192.168.10.241:3142) and apt's Proxy-Auto-Detect uses it
    for http downloads when it answers, DIRECT otherwise. https sources
    stay direct (they would only be tunnelled, never cached).

